grO(){return"GUIDE"},
guD(){return"How it works"},
gtv(){return'IronVibe deliberately ships without a built-in exercise catalog or preset "programs." It is not here to teach you how to train\u2014YouTube and real coaches already do that\u2014but to help you keep stats exactly the way you like. You type exercise names yourself, in your own words. Optionally tag a muscle group so the app can assemble a quick full-body session from your own list. The longer you use it, the more it feels like home: the app learns your habits and adapts to you, not the other way around.'},
