gtO(){return"Remove from your list"},
gtN(){return"When the suggestions list is open under the name field, tap the X on a row \u2014 or the red X in Personal Progress \u2014 to remove that name from suggestions and the progress table. Saved workouts stay unchanged."},
gu7(){return"Data fields"},
