gtI(){return"Quick workout"},
gtF(){return"Assembles a 4-exercise full-body session: chest, back, one leg movement (front or rear thigh \u2014 never both), and one accessory for shoulders, arms, or core, whichever you have trained least recently. Prefers favorites. Last weights and reps appear greyed as a target to beat \u2014 you log each set yourself."},
grS(){return"Workout calendar"},
grR(){return"See which days you trained, open a saved session, or add a workout on a chosen date and time \u2014 including past days."},
