guI(){return"I train others is for coaches. Add clients, schedule sessions, plan exercises ahead of time, and log workouts per person. Repeating the last session is optional. Export and import for coach data is separate from your personal history. Deleting a client removes future sessions but keeps past workouts for reporting."},
